\v 30 After¦223083 him¦223083 was Shelemyah's¦223089 son Hananyah¦223086 with Zalaf's¦223093 sixth¦223094 son Hanun¦223090 working on a second¦223096 section, then Berekyah's¦223103 sib Meshullam¦223100 repairing¦223099 a section in front¦223104 of¦223101 his¦223105 quarters¦223105.
