\v 12 \add ≈So¦225423\add* all¦225424 the¦225426 people¦225426 went¦225423 to¦225427 eat¦225427 and¦225428 drink¦225428 and to \add ≈take plates of¦225424 food to others\add*, and to \add ≈have a big¦225433 celebration\add* because¦225434 they¦225435 understood¦225435 what \add ≈had¦225435 been read\add* to¦225439 them¦225439.
\s1 The celebration in shelters
