\v 13 The¦225443 \add ≈next\add* day¦225442, \add ≈all¦225447 the¦225449 clan leaders\add*, and the¦225450 priests¦225450 and¦225451 Levites¦225451, met¦225444 with¦225442 Ezra¦225454 the¦225455 scribe¦225455 to¦225452 \add ≈study¦225456 the instructions¦225460\add* \add on the scroll\add*.
\v 14 They¦225462 \add ≈discovered¦225462 that it was\add* written¦225463 in¦225464 the \add ≈instructions¦225466 that Yahweh¦225467 had¦225466 given through¦225468 Mosheh¦225470\add*, that the¦225473 Israelis¦225473 should live¦225472 in¦225476 \add temporary\add* shelters during¦225478 the¦225479 celebration in their seventh¦225479 month¦225478 \add (our September-October)\add*.\x + \xo 8:14-15: \xt Lev 23:33-36,39-43; Deu 16:13-15.\x*
\v 15 They¦225482 should \add ≈publicly proclaim¦225482\add* in Yerushalem¦225488 and in all¦225485 their¦225487 towns¦225487 \add ≈that¦225481 the people should go¦225490 into the¦225491 hills¦225491 and¦225492 bring¦225492 back branches from olive or wild olive trees, myrtle¦225501 or palm¦225503 trees¦225503, and¦225504/or other\add* leafy¦225506 trees to¦225507 make¦225507 shelters as it's written¦225509.
