\v 17 Then¦225533 the whole¦225534 assembly¦225536 \add ≈of people¦225555\add* who'd come back from¦225538 captivity¦225540 made¦225533 shelters and¦225543 lived¦225543 in¦225544 them \add for one week\add*. The¦225549 \add ≈Israelis¦225555\add* hadn't done¦225548 that¦225537 since¦225549 the \add ≈time¦225549 of Yehoshua's leadership\add*, and \add ≈they¦225533 did¦225548 it¦225560 with¦225544 a lot of celebration\add*.
\v 18 \add @Ezra¦225579\add* read aloud from¦225572 the scroll¦225566 of God's¦225568 instructions each day of the seven¦225582 days¦225583 of celebration¦225579, then¦225565 on¦225566 the eighth¦225585 day they¦225579 all gathered¦225586 together as per the¦225587 instructions.
\c 9
