\v 6 \add ≈During all¦228008 that¦228010 period,\add* I hadn't been¦228012 in¦228013 Yerushalem¦228013 because¦228014 I'd returned¦228022 to¦228023 the Babylonian king in the 32nd year¦228015 of¦228026 Artahshashta's reign \add !(Artaxerxes¦228018)\add*. \add ≈However¦228018, after a while\add* I requested¦228028 leave¦228028 \add again\add* from¦228029 the¦228031 king¦228031
