\v 17 I¦228220 rebuked¦228217 the¦228219 Yehudah \add ≈business leaders\add*, asking¦228221 them¦228222, “What's¦228223 this¦228227 evil¦228226 thing¦228225 that¦228228 you're all doing¦228230—profaning¦228231 the¦228234 rest day¦228234 \add by treating it like a regular day\add*?
