\v 19 \add ≈So after that, when it¦228264 started to¦228269 get dark on Friday evenings, I ordered¦228274 that the city gates be closed¦228272, and¦228271 not¦228276 to be opened¦228277 until¦228278 after the rest day\add*. I \add ≈also¦228264 stationed¦228282 some¦228281 of¦228281 my¦228281 young men¦228277 to stand at¦228283 the¦228285 gates¦228285 to ensure that no load¦228289 could enter on¦228290 the rest day\add*.
